{
  "name": "mister-family-map",
  "private": true,
  "license": "MIT",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "type": "module",
  "description": "Carte collaborative d'idées de sorties en famille : lieux, événements et retours d'expérience réellement utiles.",
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=24.21.0"
  },
  "scripts": {
    "dev": "vite",
    "build": "tsc -b && vite build && pwa-bundle-budget",
    "preview": "vite preview",
    "format": "prettier --write .",
    "format:check": "prettier --check .",
    "lint": "eslint .",
    "type-check": "tsc -b --noEmit",
    "type-check:7": "pwa-typecheck-7",
    "test": "vitest run",
    "test:watch": "vitest",
    "test:coverage": "vitest run --coverage",
    "test:e2e": "playwright test",
    "test:e2e:critical": "playwright test --grep @critical",
    "test:e2e:a11y": "playwright test --grep @a11y",
    "icons": "pwa-icons --source public/favicon.svg --out public --no-apple",
    "icons:maskable": "node scripts/generate-maskable.mjs",
    "verify": "npm run format:check && npm run lint && npm run type-check && npm run test && npm run build",
    "mirror": "node scripts/mirror.mjs",
    "mirror:snapshot": "node scripts/mirror.mjs --mode snapshot"
  },
  "bundleBudget": {
    "totalGzipKb": 809,
    "_pourquoi": "RELEVÉ DE 750 À 809 LE 19/09/2026, APRÈS la bascule PostHog (ADR 0012). Le plafond tenait sans rien toucher — 734,6 kB pour 750 — et c'est justement le piège : 15,4 kB de marge, soit 2 %, là où la convention du parc en laisse 10 %. Un budget qu'on ne relève pas parce qu'il passe DE JUSTESSE casse au commit suivant, sur un changement sans rapport. 809 = mesure + 10 %. ET ICI LA MARGE COMPTE DOUBLE : ce dépôt privé n'a pas de minutes Actions, sa CI est sautée, et c'est le MIROIR public qui construit — une borne trop serrée s'y découvrirait après publication, pas avant."
  },
  "dependencies": {
    "@supabase/supabase-js": "^2.117.1",
    "lucide-react": "^1.47.0",
    "maplibre-gl": "^6.11.1",
    "posthog-js": "^1.434.11",
    "react": "^19.3.0",
    "react-dom": "^19.3.0",
    "react-router": "^8.4.0",
    "zod": "^4.6.5",
    "zustand": "^5.0.15"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "@axe-core/playwright": "^4.13.0",
    "@eslint/js": "^10.0.1",
    "@mister-guiiug/dev-pwa-config": "^6.11.0",
    "@playwright/test": "^1.63.0",
    "@tailwindcss/vite": "^4.3.3",
    "@testing-library/jest-dom": "^7.0.1",
    "@testing-library/react": "^16.3.3",
    "@testing-library/user-event": "^14.6.7",
    "@types/node": "^26.6.2",
    "@types/react": "^19.3.0",
    "@types/react-dom": "^19.3.0",
    "@vitejs/plugin-react": "^6.1.1",
    "@vitest/coverage-v8": "^5.0.1",
    "eslint": "^10.11.0",
    "eslint-plugin-jsx-a11y": "^6.10.2",
    "eslint-plugin-react-hooks": "^7.1.1",
    "eslint-plugin-react-refresh": "^0.5.7",
    "globals": "^17.12.0",
    "jsdom": "^30.1.1",
    "prettier": "^3.9.9",
    "sharp": "^0.35.4",
    "tailwindcss": "^4.3.3",
    "typescript": "~6.0.3",
    "typescript-7": "npm:typescript@~7.0.2",
    "typescript-eslint": "^8.70.1",
    "vite": "^8.3.0",
    "vite-plugin-pwa": "^1.3.0",
    "vitest": "^5.0.1"
  },
  "overrides": {
    "eslint-plugin-jsx-a11y": {
      "eslint": "$eslint"
    }
  }
}
